  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Dense Prefix Layers** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\ndef solution(layer_types, dense_prefix_count):\n    if dense_prefix_count<0: raise ValueError(\"prefix count cannot be negative\")\n    return [\"dense\" if i<dense_prefix_count else layer_types[i] for i in range(len(layer_types))]\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
